  "*S. Seln*" (ch1, ch26, roster), "*C. Cael*" (ch5, ch6, the card), "*K. Dellenmoor*" (ch26 the door card), "— H."
  (Hesk ×5), "— L." (Lira ch43), "— Q." (Quenna ch44). Say the letter. "the little *vs.*" = "versus".
