|---|---|---|---|
| Priority 1 — retrospective interpretation | 50–60 | **57** | 20 in ch38–43, 23 in ch54–60 |
| Priority 2 — "at once", measured pauses, repeated looks | 30–35 | **31** | 10 in ch41–43, 7 in ch57–60 |
