+
+## Chapter 50 — The Square of Grey
+
+Six scenes.
+
+1. First: `They had the day in that`  
+   Last: `still. "It stays in the bow."`  
+   Seln’s bolt tally and Lira’s responses from the stair are clearly located. `He has the hole. He has not the stair.` remains Seln because Brom’s question is tagged and Seln’s reply continues his range analysis. Clean.
+2. First: `The white lasted a long time,`  
