+   Teague’s flat `What are you.` is intentionally not a question in cadence; the next narration explicitly says there is no lift. Cael neither reads nor asks to read Teague’s wrist, and the reasoning is fully audible. Alternating answers are short but their owners are fixed by the preceding question and Teague’s narrated response. Italic log entry is introduced. Clean.
