+4. First: `It was iron, of the registry's`  
+   Last: `maps. We're not done. We're oriented.*`  
+   Stake number thirty-four, forty bars each way, twenty cords and doubled radius are internally clear. The four-person ruling precedes Cael’s refusal to enter. Karis’s map action is explicit; the italic crest log is document register. Clean.
