+- Before: `He took out Hesk's book and wrote it standing, with the pencil cold in his fingers.` Unit: `*Hundred and twenty-second day, the fork. Oryn north. On her terms. I didn't ask. Five on the bearing.*` After: scene break. The entry closes the fork scene cleanly and contains no ambiguous referent; sound.
