editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:103:2. **The compressed roads and recoveries put on the page (+38,000).** The source summarizes the six days in the fin's lee and on the mountain's lip (+4k); the four days down to Oxhollow (+4k); the six days Oxhollow→Lowmarch (+4k); days 60–69 at Lowmarch and the well on the south road (+8k); the two days stone→Thornwater with Lira flat-footed (+3k); Thornwater→Lowmarch in the first cold (+2k); the three-day bearing walk (+4k); and the six days from the fourth site home in first snow (+5k). Thornwater's three stays get texture as a place that becomes home (+4k). *Why:* the arc's freedom is made of walking and of places that feed them, and the source keeps cutting it to a sentence.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:104:3. **The six-week skip and the first contracts on the page (+16,000).** The courier at the ford; falling in behind carters; Lowmarch's first week; the cart, the horse and the purse resolved (C1); the ferry escort, the fence-line and the wash as three short episodes; the meadow. *Why:* the source does all of this in a log. The edition's opening has to show the freedom before it complicates it, and to teach the board as a system.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:106:5. **Learning encounters (+25,000).** Holding as a discipline ("the hold"): Lira running without the burst, Brom carrying without hardening, Karis keeping one point, Cael cataloguing his nine as held things with idle rents (+4k). Karis's discharge hypothesis tested (+1.5k). The shale-back study day (+2k). Oryn's field-care and two-readings teaching (+2.5k). The perimeter procedure and the six trials (+3k). The loft covenant (+1.5k). The listening cascade (+2k). The strata demonstration (+1.5k). The reading taught on the road (+1k). The wyrm trials (+2k). **New: Lira learns to shoot braced one-armed from Thornwater's bowman** during the week of tables (+4k). That plants Ch21, where "she could not span a bow one-armed… and could shoot one." *Why:* the formula's front-loaded teaching (§7), and so every winning mechanism is taught before it is used.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:107:6. **Supporting-cast arcs on the page (+12,000).** Private wants and independent decisions for Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln, Oryn, Teague and Pike, and small beats for the steading's woman, the bowman and Teague's crew (§6). Many small beats, no deuteragonist.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:108:7. **Seam repairs staged as scenes (+5,000).** The horse, cart and purse (C1). Oryn leaving her mule with the crew at Thornwater (C2). Karis pacing the Stair's perimeter on the morning of the 115th and laying the cord at the Hall on the 120th, so that Ch23's "paced two and cord-measured the third" is true on the page (C3).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:112:**Do not add:** any new fight with stillhounds before the Ring, which would spend the Ring's surprise. Any Compact face, name, policy, directive or office scene beyond Vastin's window. Any new Shadow-adjacent use (it is used exactly twice: Ring, Stair). Any fragment use in M1–M3 beyond the ford's single burst (the log counts "Deployment since the Line: one" through day 90). Any Daeva or Reydan contact beyond one log line each. Any Ephram, Withrow, Rooke or Bracken scene (letters only). Any Coss, Havel or Ilsev. Any Teague-crew name.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:125:| 6 | 38–44 | 36,000 | 100–112 | B7 Ch14–16 (+ Oryn's road north) | Nineteen; the still middle located; the Quieting named; Lira first; the rule written. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:129:**Physical challenge or learning encounter per movement:** M1 the wash recovery, the hold drilled, the Thornwater stretch walked at dusk · M2 the ford (developed fight), the well, Lira's first runs on a stiff ankle · M3 the fan haul, the bench, the stampede (terrain fight), the lip · M4 the perimeter walk and the six trials inside the line (a learning encounter for every one of the six) · M5 the Ring (central set piece), the deep reading · M6 **the deliberate quieter movement:** the bowman's one-armed shooting lessons, Cael relearning the Wind economy in Thornwater's yard under the listening, and the strata demonstration · M7 the run to the stair, the stalemate, the ascent and the rim · M8 the wyrm trials and the Hall, then the walk home into first snow.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:139:**Two hard rules for every window:** (1) **No member of Teague's crew is named, ever**, including in Teague's own head. Book 8 kills "the young one" at the pass and says his name once without entering it. Teague thinks of his people as the spear, the bow, the boy and the healer, which is how a captain counts. (2) **Oryn's holds stay unnamed** except Oxhollow, Thornwater and Millrace. In her head they are what they owe her or what is there: the hold with the child; the hold that gave the coat; the fourth, four days on.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:143:| **Oryn** | 9,200 (3.1%) | M3: 2,600 (Oxhollow's gate north, days 84–92: the hand she owed, the child three stops on, "a patient I want to read whole"; she puts a day on the route) · M6: 2,000 (day 100, the stool after the telling, the book on her knee: being a patient's source) · M6: 1,800 (days 111–112, the road north after leaving her mule with the crew; ends before Millrace's table) · M8: 2,800 (days 122–~128, the gap to Thornwater, the old woman's knee, writing the letter; ends on its four lines) | Her route, its arithmetic and debts; her city and why she left; her hands' findings; from day 100, the mechanism as told; the line's rule, which she tested alone; what she felt in him | Any theory of what he is or why the Quiet does not touch him ("I'm a healer, not a theorist"); the still place before he tells her (day 120); the content of Karis's hypothesis; anything about the Compact beyond what was said at a table; any sentimental declaration — her register breaks once, at the Hall, in Cael's POV |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:144:| **Teague** | 8,200 (2.7%) | M1: 1,500 (day 49, the door: counting his three, then the job, then the five) · M3: 1,400 (Oxhollow's ford at dusk: the four sentences as a price) · M4: 1,200 (day 89: reading the Fallow slip twice, putting it back, telling Pike) · M7: 2,400 (days 113–115: not back from the Stair, the walk south to look, the rim's ground read, the crossbows, holding the rim at dawn) · M8: 1,700 (days 117–120: following the trail with the healer, sitting down beside the boy, "a new column") | What a captain reads off ground, faces and paper; the board; his own unreported Bronze and why ("I'd sooner be worth what I did than what they wrote"); that the Stair slip was wrong, by instinct; what he saw on the rim (a declaration *outside* the line) | The mechanism; anything working *inside* a line; any crew member's name; any Compact link beyond "a bad contract"; any envy or villainy — he is honest, priced, and the mirror of a found family without a Cael in it |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:145:| **Seln** | 7,600 (2.5%) | M1: 1,800 (days 10–40: walking every road out of Lowmarch, and later Thornwater, alone; the report nobody asks for) · M5: 2,000 (day 97, at the stone, then the stake: the maps with holes unlocking; ends as he asks for the carter's map) · M7: 2,200 (night of day 112: the second slip held against the first in his head; twelve years carrying the case; wanting a face) [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit B6, C2] · M8: 1,600 (days 124–128: the ledger in his coat on the road home; giving it to Karis) | His fifteen years; the maps he carried and their blanks; the registry's form-prose; the case's known contents (the machine's maintenance records, read in B6); his read of the trap; his anger | Where the Quieting file is or what it says ("I carried the maps. I never saw the file."); any face or name on the rim; the case opened; the index decoded; the stroke-and-bar decoded; any sentence of affection said aloud |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:146:| **Karis** | 7,400 (2.5%) | M2: 1,400 (day 58, the cart-yard: "everybody knows", and not asking) · M4: 1,400 (night of day 95 at the stone: writing a stride, not a hypothesis) · M6: 2,600 (the week of tables: the tally of kinds she will not say; *the Quieting* chosen as grammar; the pen held over the page) · M8: 2,000 (days 119–120 at the far fire: the three centres, the edge laid and moved; ends on the pencil stopping) | Method; every number; her shelves; the strata; that she holds a hypothesis; that she is afraid of it | **The content of the hypothesis** (Book 8/9 territory) — the window stops her pen exactly as the page does; [UNBOUND] (used once, aloud, in the Ch15 equivalent, and never in her head); any who/why for the floors or the line |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:147:| **Lira** | 7,600 (2.5%) | M2: 1,800 (day 53, the bar at dusk without Wind: fast, with nothing at the end) · M3: 1,800 (day 78, the ledge: the burst her body chose; "That was me. The loud thing.") · M5: 2,000 (days 97–98: one arm, the order, "Later" kept; walking flat-footed because Oryn said) · M6: 2,000 (the bowman's lessons: shooting braced, one-armed, with a bow somebody else spans) | Everything she knows (the log, the fragments); her Fenmark and Norhold history; her want; her body's counts | Why Cael's fragments work inside before he tells her (day 110); any escalation of Cael–Lira past what the source shows (warmth and covenant, not declaration); asking for the ankle twice |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:160:| Lira | To become something nobody has seen yet, with no ladder to say so ("what am I becoming, exactly, if nobody's measuring?") | Says "I could clear it" once and does not; runs the bar without Wind; the ledge; takes Oryn's order and keeps it past the first mile; learns to shoot braced one-armed; instigates the birthday and pays; "Walk away" entered and goes anyway; runs *down* to the stair; keeps the bolt in the bow; never asks for the ankle twice | 18 |
