editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/STATE_LEDGER.md:54:- **Road times (prose, fixed):** Lowmarch ↔ Thornwater two days; Thornwater → the Fallow rise two days; Lowmarch → Oxhollow six days (north-west); Lowmarch → Millrace one day south on the Stair road; Millrace's fork → the Stair's line the same afternoon; the Stair → the Hall three days along the bearing; the Hall → the fork one day; the fork → the fourth site a day and a half; the fourth site → Lowmarch six days; the fourth site's gap → Thornwater four days.
