+## Closing mechanical audit
+
+- Coverage: fifteen chapters, eighty scenes, 74,480 words, all read in full from numbered output and recorded above.
+- Quote scan: 2,432 straight double-quote marks; no odd-quote paragraph, no unresolved multi-paragraph quotation and no curly double quote. All 268 asterisks pair; italics flatten without leaving a marker.
