+## Chapter 60 — Alignment
+
+Six scenes.
+
+1. First: `Karis asked for the room before`  
+   Last: `a hand's length at a time.`  
+   Karis owns the sheet count and the joined speech at line 25; Lira’s count from the door is tagged. The italic night log and the protected inventory are explicitly introduced as writing and should take document register. All counts are spelled out; the inventory’s Path/person pairings remain audible despite its length. Clean.
